/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (Application Programming Interfaces \(APIs\) allow software applications to communicate and exchange data over networks. APIs are widely used in web applications, mobile applications, and cloud services for accessing and managing data. Since APIs often expose sensitive information and business functionality, improper security controls can lead to unauthorized access, data leakage, and account compromise.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
